{"id":"H3337","lemma":"יֵ֫צֶר","transliteration":"yetser","sayIt":"ye-tser","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Jezer","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Naphtali living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Gen.46.24;\nson of: Naphtali (H5321);\nbrother of: Jahzeel (H3183), Guni (H1476) and Shillem (H8006)\nAlso named: yits.ri (יִצְרִי \"Jezerite\" H3340)\n§ Jezer = \"forming\"\nthe 3rd son of Naphtali and the founder of the family of Jezerites","glosses":["jezer"],"count":3,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-46","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jezer","kjv":"and Jezer"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":49,"renderings":{"bsb":"from Jezer","kjv":"Of Jezer"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jezer","kjv":"and Jezer"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 46:24","note":"The sons of Naphtali: Jahzeel, Guni, Jezer, and Shillem.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Numbers 26:49","note":"of Jezer, the family of the Jezerites; of Shillem, the family of the Shillemites.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:13","note":"The sons of Naphtali: Jahziel, Guni, Jezer, Shallum, and the sons of Bilhah.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H3340","lemma":"יִצְרִי","transliteration":"yitsri","gloss":"Jezerite"},{"id":"H1476","lemma":"גּוּנִי","transliteration":"guni","gloss":"Guni"},{"id":"H3183","lemma":"יַחְצְאֵל","transliteration":"yachtseel","gloss":"Jahzeel"},{"id":"H5321","lemma":"נַפְתָּלִי","transliteration":"naphtali","gloss":"Naphtali"},{"id":"H8006","lemma":"שִׁלֵּם","transliteration":"shillem","gloss":"Shillem"},{"id":"H1477","lemma":"גּוּנִי","transliteration":"guni","gloss":"Gunite"},{"id":"H3184","lemma":"יַחְצְאֵלִי","transliteration":"yachtseeli","gloss":"Jahzeelite"},{"id":"H3185","lemma":"יַחְצִיאֵל","transliteration":"yachtsiel","gloss":"Jahziel"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}